  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0: Fixes default(T) being treated as expired, collection helpers removing the wrong item, non-permanent expiration, unit-mixing sort order and value leakage in exception messages. Adds Decay.Of(...) builder, type-inferred Decay.OnCount/OnExpiration/OnCondition, TryGetValue, GetValueOrDefault, Expire(), ExpirationReason, access/expiry state properties and TimeProvider support. Targets netstandard2.0 and net10.0. See the README's \"Upgrading from 1.x\" section for behavior changes.",
